# File and Folder Naming

Use **kebab-case** for all file and folder names in this project.

- **Allowed**: `user-profile.tsx`, `grade-calculator.ts`, `empty-state.tsx`, `entry-client.tsx`
- **Not allowed**: `UserProfile.tsx`, `userProfile.ts`, `user_profile.ts`, `emptyState.tsx`

Apply this when:

- Creating new files or folders
- Renaming existing files or folders
- Suggesting paths in code (imports, routes, assets)

Example:

```
src/
  components/
    grade-calculator/
      grade-calculator.tsx
      grade-display.tsx
  lib/
    format-grade.ts
```
